menu "Headset: user interface (modules/hs_ui)"

    config HS_UI_POWER_OFF_HOLD_MS
        int "Hold the power switch this long to power off (ms)"
        default 2500
        range 1000 10000
        help
            Long enough not to happen by accident in a pocket; the LED fades
            red when it fires. A shorter press shows the battery level.

    config HS_UI_WHEEL_MAX_STEPS
        int "Most volume steps one wheel event may produce"
        default 4
        range 1 32
        help
            A fast flick arrives as one event with several detents; capping it
            keeps a flick from jumping the host volume to silence or full.

    config HS_UI_WHEEL_REVERSE
        bool "Reverse the thumbwheel's sense"
        default n
        help
            Until the mechanical design fixes which way is "up" (the encoder is
            a placeholder part on ORGA v1).

endmenu
